      "summaries": {
        "en": "biliTickerBuy is an open-source Python tool that automates ticket purchasing for Bilibili's membership store, solving the problem of missing limited-edition tickets due to manual delays. It uses the bilibili-api to interact with Bilibili's backend, simulating user actions like login, ticket selection, and checkout with configurable timing. Technically, it leverages asynchronous requests and retry logic to handle high concurrency. You can customize it for specific events, integrate it into scripts, or study its API interaction patterns for similar automation tasks.",
        "zh": "biliTickerBuy 是一个开源 Python 工具，专门用于自动化 B 站会员购的抢票流程，解决手动抢票时因延迟而错失限量票的问题。它通过调用 bilibili-api 模拟用户登录、选票、提交订单等操作，并支持自定义抢票时间间隔和重试次数，以应对高并发场景。其技术亮点在于使用异步请求和重试机制，提升抢票成功率。你可以直接配置参数用于特定活动，或将其集成到自动化脚本中，也可以学习其 API 交互模式，用于其他平台的类似自动化任务。",
        "es": "biliTickerBuy is an open-source Python tool that automates ticket purchasing for Bilibili's membership store, solving the problem of missing limited-edition tickets due to manual delays. It uses the bilibili-api to interact with Bilibili's backend, simulating user actions like login, ticket selection, and checkout with configurable timing. Technically, it leverages asynchronous requests and retry logic to handle high concurrency. You can customize it for specific events, integrate it into scripts, or study its API interaction patterns for similar automation tasks.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "biliTickerBuy stands out for bilibili, bilibili-api, and manga in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "biliTickerBuy is an open-source Python tool that automates ticket purchasing for Bilibili's membership store, solving the problem of missing limited-edition tickets due to manual delays. It uses the bilibili-api to interact with Bilibili's backend, simulating user actions like login, ticket selection, and checkout with configurable timing. Technically, it leverages asynchronous requests and retry logic to handle high concurrency. You can customize it for specific events, integrate it into scripts, or study its API interaction patterns for similar automation tasks.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/mikumifa/biliTickerBuy for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
